 "sentences": [
  "Rome's Colosseum held up to 80,000 spectators.",
  "This massive elliptical amphitheatre sits right near the Roman Forum.",
  "Emperor Vespasian started construction in AD 72, and Titus finished it in AD 80.",
  "The Flavian dynasty built it using travertine, tuff, and Roman concrete.",
  "Crowds once watched gladiatorial contests, animal hunts, and public executions.",
  "It remains the largest standing amphitheatre in the entire world today."
